# Project Map

`SOUL.md` - product taste and non-negotiables
`README.md` - public project overview
`AGENTS.md` - coding-agent rules and routing
`docs/README.md` - documentation index and authority
`docs/backend/architecture.md` - system boundaries and modules
`docs/backend/runtime.md` - execution identity, persistence, events, cancellation
`docs/backend/state-machine.md` - LangGraph state and transition rules
`docs/backend/artifacts.md` - immutable artifact contracts and provenance
`docs/backend/pipeline.md` - shared pipeline model
`docs/backend/langgraph.md` - LangGraph usage decisions
`docs/backend/comfyui.md` - ComfyUI and provider boundary
`docs/pipelines/cinematic.md` - cinematic graph
`docs/pipelines/music-video.md` - music-video graph
`docs/pipelines/serial.md` - season and episode graphs
`docs/agents/README.md` - agent catalog and common contract
`docs/agents/*.md` - one capability contract per agent/service
`docs/tools/tools.md` - typed tool and service registry
`docs/rag/architecture.md` - wiki, retrieval, multimodal context, lifecycle
`docs/rag/chunks/chunks.md` - reusable creative-memory types
`docs/frontend/webui.md` - product UI surfaces
`docs/roadmap.md` - implementation order
`docs/refactoring.md` - migration brief
`skills/LangGraph/` - local LangGraph reference docs
`skills/llm-wiki/` - local LLM Wiki reference
`skills/comfyui-skill/` - ComfyUI reference implementation
`legacy/` - read-only old-project evidence
`.agents/` - future production agent builds

`.mdc` auto-application is editor-specific. OpenCode relies on `AGENTS.md`; compatible Cursor-style clients can use this file because `alwaysApply: true` is set.
